         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Division and Remainder\n\nChoose how the division is written: **Result below** the bar (as in many schoolbooks) or **Result on top** of it (a format that appears in historical mathematical documents).\n\nThe division goes from the highest place value to the lowest. Use the **up** and **down** arrows to choose each digit of the quotient. When a digit is right, the step is recorded and the next digit is brought down. At the end you receive a medal, and the **New division** button starts another division.",
